# enabled on main — make the required approval human-only: a GitHub App cannot
# satisfy CODEOWNERS, so an installed App's approval cannot stand in for a
# maintainer's. The single rule maps every path to the same maintainer set, so one
# approval satisfies both the required review and the code-owner requirement.
